~ levy

arc_auditor: Astral Resource Corporation, compliance division. We docked twenty minutes ago. You were not required to be notified.
arc_auditor: There is a levy against this station's trading profits. Three hundred credits, effective immediately.

- Pay the levy
	$> station.credits(-300)
	arc_auditor: Noted and filed. The Corporation appreciates a station that understands its position.
	=> END
- Stall the auditors
	$> station.mood("arc_levy_unrest", -0.1, 24.0)
	arc_auditor: Then we will need to interview your crew. All of them. Today.
	The paperwork gets lost. The crew spend a shift being asked the same questions instead of resting.
	=> END
